      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Sea View Embassy House: Dublin\r\nThe location of this stunning two-story villa is exceptional, with panoramic uninterrupted views of Dublin Bay. The picturesque village of Dalkey is a 15-minute stroll and offers an abundance of amenities, including shops, boutiques, restaurants and recreational facilities. This deluxe, well-appointed family residence is bright, spacious, and has a southerly aspect with splendid views of Dublin Bay, Dalkey Island, Killiney Bay and Sugarloaf Mountain.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is approximately 427 sqm (4600 sqft) and comprises a pillared entrance porch, reception hall, guest WC, two reception rooms, kitchen/breakfast room, games room, shower room, sauna and six bedrooms, four en-suite. A flight of 20 steps leads from a private car park to the entrance door."
      },
      {
